<title>UK: UK meals/feeds closed down with Chicago, no trade - Dec 23.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds closed down with Chicago, no trade - Dec 23.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK meals and feeds market closed lower in line with Chicago but was tradeless due to pre-Christmas apathy setting in.</p>
<p>Further falls were likely on Tuesday if Chicago continues its early decline, but trade wasn't expected to take off whatever happens.</p>
<p>Soybean meal selling levels at the close were mostly one to two sterling per tonne down on Friday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8074</p>
